flowchart LR
  U1[User A / Browser session] --> WEB[Next.js Web UI :8080]
  U2[User B / Isolated browser session] --> WEB
  WEB --> AUTH[mcp-auth-workspace :4001\nRS256 JWT · RBAC · Prisma]
  WEB --> MSG[mcp-messaging :4002\nWebSocket · E2EE envelopes]
  WEB --> RTC[mcp-media-rtc :4003\nWebRTC signaling]
  WEB --> ST[mcp-storage :4004\nPresigned upload/download]
  WEB --> AI[mcp-ai-agent :4005\nSummarization / transcription]
  AUTH --> PG[(PostgreSQL\nUsers · Workspaces · Members\nInvites · Agenda · Notes · Tasks)]
  MSG --> PG2[(PostgreSQL\nChannels · Messages · Receipts)]
  ST --> MINIO[(MinIO S3\nEncrypted files)]
  AUTH --> REDIS[(Redis\nSessions / coordination)]
  MSG --> REDIS
  RTC --> REDIS
  AUTH -.->|member.joined| MSG
  WEB -.->|access token + membership| AUTH
  WEB -.->|ciphertext only| MSG

  subgraph TenantBoundary[Workspace / Tenant boundary]
    TEAM[Team shared space\nChannels · Work plan · Members]
    PRIVATE[Personal space\nPrivate Agenda · Notes · Sessions]
  end
  AUTH --> TEAM
  AUTH --> PRIVATE
  TEAM -.->|explicit sharing only| PRIVATE
